  "credits": "Sagitario and La Mina: survey by CINDAQ (Fred Devos, Sam Meacham, Dominique Rissolo). Fig. 1C of B. L. MacDonald et al., \"Paleoindian ochre mines in the submerged caves of the Yucatán Peninsula, Quintana Roo, Mexico\", Science Advances 6, eaba1219 (2020), doi:10.1126/sciadv.aba1219. Licence CC BY-NC 4.0.",
